from a dairy product by eating, putting a little butter on my toast or whatever I'm eating

00:01:30,440 --> 00:01:36,120
or by eating a bowl of ice cream? Well, pretty simple answer to that.

00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:43,120
So when you're off of a food because it's a driver to the cancer, it's not, it's a occult.

