an issue. But it's so stayed off of something you're trying to eliminate 90 to 95% of that

00:02:13,680 --> 00:02:20,840
thing in your diet to decrease a feed the fuel source for the cancer so things slow down.

00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:24,760
So to answer the question, yeah, you could still eat some butter. Should you eat it like

